---
title: Recovery history · bounded
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px

    [*] --> count : prior record complete
    state count <<choice>>
    count --> archive : [fewer than 8 proven]
    count --> prune : [8 proven]
    prune --> archive : oldest proven removed
    archive --> recovered : record moved aside
    recovered --> [*]

    note right of count
        Counts only regular files named
        for their own digest whose
        contents prove them finished.
    end note
    note left of prune
        Same locks as the recovery;
        the file removed is the file
        read (device and inode).
    end note
    note right of recovered
        Before: at 8 the recovery
        refused for ever.
    end note

    class recovered ok
